{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_043_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:24b37d7b7aad339af0197f8a92496df824febba32cf5ab95b4e19de6a538c827",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_043_22:5_02_043_22_a:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:698ef149b8a79618620acf1fd13f7c343ce14c6535bbff2811318454a3f259b2",
      "text": "……●●●●プロデューサー，能借用你一点时间\n吗？我有想交给你的东西。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_043_22:5_02_043_22_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f55f8ac09d44dbd0edc013cee8bb12fe011a3017b11913bb9aada42c7dbd6e50",
      "text": "……我把情人节巧克力的回礼带来了。\n收下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_043_22:5_02_043_22_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0fda750468a1cd402bcc692adeb33fc3a1839bd57b4e3900c25fe1190b79cffb",
      "text": "……白色情人节的礼物中，\n想必寄宿着各式各样的含义吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_043_22:5_02_043_22_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:322f34dbc47fddd28be6eb6b78a65fb544dd801c0344e12d3d62249f2b760a88",
      "text": "……若是去对应想要表达的心情，礼品的数量不知不觉就增多了，\n要把它们归结为一个真是花了不少心思。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_043_22:5_02_043_22_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3468908f5c226988df9de82cba4be885c651d472220ded148fdbd476ccb86344",
      "text": "……这份回礼，我挑选了最接近我想回赠给你的心情的物品。\n若是能合你心意，我会很高兴的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_043_22:5_02_043_22_b:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70c617c6a4fed5f2518c4eea85248f47ec6fa3b4099ae7a7d0d7b04b356a83f1",
      "text": "……是●●●●プロデューサー啊。\n把你叫出来真不好意思。请借我一点时间。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_043_22:5_02_043_22_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bcd3d189e0604aa5ffe3315d29fc531f49275df2f323287698e72ab55e915c42",
      "text": "……这是白色情人节的礼物。请收下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_043_22:5_02_043_22_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71c0f0acc002c21ccd4e8e5f0b6898edeec1088b757034d7429ebd85ffb14e95",
      "text": "……情人节的巧克力，我品尝到了最后一块。\n真的非常美味哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_043_22:5_02_043_22_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f33feaec6226a801cef15c0a8b55b449649a39bf30bcecfa6556b0ecc0763d34",
      "text": "……想必是因为里面倾注了\n制作人的心意吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_043_22:5_02_043_22_b:cmd-000029:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:617b8d3c190cdd11477677df06809ca342a697deb336435e931fb1786bfac693",
      "text": "是的！倾注了我的Passion！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_043_22:5_02_043_22_b:cmd-000030:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0fad09232b4e4013cbfd3910f5af29ca40623280d4a8a12f3fc23a22a73f5322",
      "text": "能合一希先生的口味，太好了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_043_22:5_02_043_22_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26bda0ddadbee19184fd0df88e0b652a4b0ef8ad5339a04c13f92a57015db23e",
      "text": "……原来是这么回事啊。吃了那盒巧克力感觉整个人都变有精神了，\n现在我终于明白其中的缘由了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_043_22:5_02_043_22_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc2343481d14fa4c7697f07c301367040c22278b8108a493980154a7e73038cb",
      "text": "……嗯，非常美味。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_043_22:5_02_043_22_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:397e4d035e91e62024b29eab98badd4caf925097910b9364ac33322b0fe27a31",
      "text": "……制作人，当时的我也是……不。\n这种事不该问出口呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_043_22:5_02_043_22_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19856e74ddbb532236f1b5d2ac81ad4843bdb3d75d1eee89cf1a03056f0e02a2",
      "text": "……回礼的内容如果能让你感到开心，我也很高兴。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
